{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban LGBT+ conversion therapy and make it a criminal offence",
        "additional_details": "We believe the law should protect LGBT+ people in all spheres of life. We feel allowing conversion therapy within British communities; whether within religious communities or in family units is not acceptable in a modern, liberal society.\r\n \r\nWe believe conversion therapy not only causes huge harm and trauma to LGBT+ people but also breaches the equal rights of LGBT+ people who are forced to experience conversion therapy. In our view, there is no credible evidence to show that conversion therapy is effective in changing someone\u2019s sexuality or gender identity.",
        "background": "We want the Government to ban all forms of LGBT+ conversion therapy that aim to change the sexual orientation and gender identity of LGBT+ individuals. We believe it should be a criminal offence for people to carry out conversion therapy on members of the LGBT+ community.",
